---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Production | Roos Instruments"}
  description={"Roos Instruments production reliability with simple user interface."}
  active={["nav-services"]}>
    <!-- ==========================
    	BREADCRUMB - START
    =========================== -->
    <section class="breadcrumb-wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Production</h2>
        <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li><a href="/index.html">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services.html">Services</a></li>
          <li class="active">Production</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ==========================
    	BREADCRUMB - END
    =========================== -->

    <div id="content" class="roosC container">

      <h1>Test Executive</h1>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-4 col-sm-push-8">
          <img style="max-width: 300px;" alt="Test Executive" src="/images/Start.png">
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-8 col-sm-pull-4">
          <p style="margin-top: 40px;" class="main">
            Operator User Interface is Simple and effective.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Simple UI for collecting Lot Information</li>
            <li>Input data with Barcode Scanner</li>
            <li>Immediate Alert information for any hardware setup issues</li>
            <li>Absolute Repeatability with Guru</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-5 col-md-offset-7 col-sm-offset-6">
          <h2>Test Release Workflow</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-5">
          <img class="rightImgAlignH1-H3" style="max-width: 500px;" alt="Release Workflow"
            src="/images/Workflow_Chalkboard.jpg">
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-7">
          <div class="main col-md-offset-2 col-lg-offset-4">
            Strong assurances that the test data is accurate with Guru&trade;.
            <ul style="margin: 0 40px 0 0;" class="hidden-xs text-right">
              <li>Rapid Development Model with Univeral Backups</li>
              <li>Data Integrity Verification</li>
              <li>Instant System Controller Recovery</li>
              <li>Offline Test Development via Virtual Workstations</li>
            </ul>
            <ul class="visible-xs-block">
              <li>Rapid Development Model with Univeral Backups</li>
              <li>Data Integrity Verification</li>
              <li>Instant System Controller Recovery</li>
              <li>Offline Test Development via Virtual Workstations</li>
            </ul>
            <br>
            <a href="guru.html" style="float: right;" class="hidden-xs link">Learn More about Guru&trade; &raquo;</a>
            <a href="guru.html" class="visible-xs-block link">Learn More about Guru&trade; &raquo;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr class="space">
      <h2>Hander/Prober Interface</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-4 col-sm-push-8 rightImgAlignH1-H3">
          <img style="max-width: 300px;" alt="Handler/Prober Interface" src="/images/Cassini16_Dimensions.gif">
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-8 col-sm-pull-4">
          <p class="main">
            Simple interface to your handler with built-in manipulator to position the DUT exactly where it needs to
            be.<br>
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Universal Docking Plates</li>
            <li>Handler Pod interface to Serial,Parallel, or GPIB</li>
            <li>Cable "Soft-dock" solutions for Probe &amp; Turret cards.</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="locked-small link" title="Cassini Site Preparation Guidelines"
            href="https://roos.com/docs/RBEH-6Z5482?Open">Access Cassini Site Preparation Guide &raquo;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
</Base>
